WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.894 --> 00:00:01.894
NAME A FEW.

00:00:01.895 --> 00:00:05.398
BUT FIRST, MY OPEN.

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:06.933
WE WERE IN A DARK AND DANGEROUS

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:09.035
PLACE IN AMERICA WHERE POLITICS

00:00:09.036 --> 00:00:12.805
IS DRIVING OUR SYSTEM OF

00:00:12.806 --> 00:00:13.139
JUSTICE.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.309
INSTEAD OF LADY JUSTICE BEING

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:17.677
BLIND TO POLITICS.

00:00:17.678 --> 00:00:23.649
THE STORY OF LIEUTENANT GENERAL

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.586
LIKELE FLYNN, IN THE END IT'S SO

00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:28.454
MUCH BIGGER THAN POLITICS.

00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:31.858
WHETHER USUAL LEFT, RIGHT,

00:00:31.859 --> 00:00:33.192
AGNOSTIC OR INDIFFERENT.

00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:37.463
AT ITS CORE, THIS IS A STORY OF

00:00:37.464 --> 00:00:37.997
INJUSTICE.

00:00:37.998 --> 00:00:41.734
IT INVOLVES THE USUAL PLAYERS,

00:00:41.735 --> 00:00:44.237
PROTAGONISTS, ANTAGONISTS.

00:00:44.238 --> 00:00:49.242
PRETTY MUCH KNOW THE WHO, WHAT,

00:00:49.243 --> 00:00:51.477
WHERE, WHEN, AND HOW.

00:00:51.478 --> 00:00:52.979
THE FUNDAMENTAL QUESTION.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:58.217
ON JANUARY 24, 017 WAS MICHAEL

00:00:58.218 --> 00:01:00.820
FLYNN TREATED AS PER THE RULES

00:01:00.821 --> 00:01:03.156
LIKE ANY OTHER FBI TARGET?

00:01:03.157 --> 00:01:06.225
THE ANSWER A RESOUNDING NO.

00:01:06.226 --> 00:01:09.562
HE WAS TREATED DIFFERENTLY.

00:01:09.563 --> 00:01:12.732
WHICH BRINGS US TO THE QUESTION,

00:01:12.733 --> 00:01:12.999
WHY?

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.569
THE ANSWER TO WHY BRINGS US TO

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.838
AN UNSETTLING PLACE.

00:01:18.839 --> 00:01:20.506
FOREIGN TO ALL OF US WHO HAVE

00:01:20.507 --> 00:01:23.409
SPENT OUR CAREERS REVERING THE

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:25.611
AMERICAN SYSTEM OF JUSTICE.

00:01:25.612 --> 00:01:27.713
IT IS THAT SYSTEM OF JUSTICE

00:01:27.714 --> 00:01:30.183
THAT DISTINGUISHES US FROM OTHER

00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:30.550
COUNTRIES.

00:01:30.551 --> 00:01:33.386
WE ARE FAIR, WE STRIVE TO

00:01:33.387 --> 00:01:34.587
ACHIEVE JUSTICE FOR ALL.

00:01:34.588 --> 00:01:38.858
NO ONE IS ABOVE OUR LAW, AND NO

00:01:38.859 --> 00:01:41.260
ONE IS BENEATH IT.

00:01:41.261 --> 00:01:43.496
IT'S WHY PEOPLE CLAMOR TO COME

00:01:43.497 --> 00:01:45.698
HERE LEGALLY AND ILLEGALLY.

00:01:45.699 --> 00:01:48.134
AS STRONG AS THE STATUE OF

00:01:48.135 --> 00:01:51.104
LIBERTY IS IN THE HARBOR OF NEW

00:01:51.105 --> 00:01:51.437
YORK.

00:01:51.438 --> 00:01:54.307
IT ALSO IS A SYMBOL OF BLIND

00:01:54.308 --> 00:01:56.042
LADY JUSTICE IN COURTROOMS

00:01:56.043 --> 00:01:57.143
ACROSS THIS GREAT NATION.

00:01:57.144 --> 00:01:59.946
THE FACTS OF THIS STORY ARE

00:01:59.947 --> 00:02:00.780
SIMPLE.

00:02:00.781 --> 00:02:02.982
FLYNN WAS IN THE CROSS-HAIRS OF

00:02:02.983 --> 00:02:04.684
THE FBI, TARGETED BY THE SAME

00:02:04.685 --> 00:02:10.156
PLAYERS WHO WHEN KNOW FROM

00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:12.158
PUBLICIZED TEXT MESSAGES AND

00:02:12.159 --> 00:02:15.061
EMAILS TRYING TO PREVENT A

00:02:15.062 --> 00:02:16.529
CERTAIN CANDIDATE FROM BECOMING

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.498
PRESIDENT AND PROMOTE ANOTHER.

00:02:18.499 --> 00:02:21.134
THEY WERE DIRT WHICH, THEY WERE

00:02:21.135 --> 00:02:23.269
LIARS, THEY WERE LEAKERS, AND

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:24.036
THEY WERE CORRUPT.

00:02:24.037 --> 00:02:26.873
THERE IS ONE IMPORTANT FACT THAT

00:02:26.874 --> 00:02:29.142
YOU NEED TO REMEMBER.

00:02:29.143 --> 00:02:30.776
THE CONVERSATION FLYNN HAD WITH

00:02:30.777 --> 00:02:33.546
THE RUSSIAN AMBASSADOR DURING

00:02:33.547 --> 00:02:36.782
THE TRANSITION WAS LEGAL.

00:02:36.783 --> 00:02:37.550
PERFECTLY LEGAL.

00:02:37.551 --> 00:02:40.186
TAKE THAT ONE TO THE BANK.

00:02:40.187 --> 00:02:44.323
IT IS WHAT IS DONE IN EVERY NEW

00:02:44.324 --> 00:02:45.291
ADMINISTRATION.

00:02:45.292 --> 00:02:47.827
THE SETUP, MICHAEL FLYNN WAS

00:02:47.828 --> 00:02:50.129
CALLED BY DEPUTY FBI DIRECTOR

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.797
ANDREW McCABE AND TOLD THAT

00:02:51.798 --> 00:02:53.799
THE FBI WANTED TO TALK TO FLYNN

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.201
ABOUT THE RUGS.

00:02:55.202 --> 00:02:57.970
AND THE QUICKEST WAY TO DO IT

00:02:57.971 --> 00:03:00.139
WAS TO KEEP THE LAWYERS OUT.

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:03.276
A CLEAR VIOLATION OF PROTOCOL,

00:03:03.277 --> 00:03:05.211
WHITE HOUSE RULES, AND

00:03:05.212 --> 00:03:06.879
ULTIMATELY FLYNN'S

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:07.980
CONSTITUTIONAL RIGHTS.

00:03:07.981 --> 00:03:10.716
WE KNOW THIS BECAUSE U.S.

00:03:10.717 --> 00:03:13.953
DISTRICT COURT JUDGE EMMITT

00:03:13.954 --> 00:03:16.556
SULLIVAN ORDERED PROSECUTORS TO

00:03:16.557 --> 00:03:21.127
HAND OVER FBI FILES OF THE FLYNN

00:03:21.128 --> 00:03:22.195
INTERROGATION INSTEAD OF

00:03:22.196 --> 00:03:25.064
EXTENSION HIM AS SCHEDULES.

00:03:25.065 --> 00:03:27.400
48 HOURS LATER THE FILES ARE

00:03:27.401 --> 00:03:29.635
HANDED OVER AS PER THE JUDGE'S

00:03:29.636 --> 00:03:30.736
DIRECTIVE.

00:03:30.737 --> 00:03:32.471
ALTHOUGH INCOMPLETE AND

00:03:32.472 --> 00:03:33.339
REDACTED.

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:36.409
THEY CONFIRM WHAT DIRECTOR COMEY

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:38.077
HIMSELF ADMITTED.

00:03:38.078 --> 00:03:40.279
AND WHAT THE JUDGE APPARENTLY

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:40.846
SUSPECTED.

00:03:40.847 --> 00:03:44.150
THE DOJ AND FBI HATCHED A PLAN

00:03:44.151 --> 00:03:47.019
TO DELIBERATELY AND

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.788
INTENTIONALLY AVOID PROTOCOL,

00:03:48.789 --> 00:03:50.756
STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE IN

00:03:50.757 --> 00:03:54.160
AN EFFORT TO ENTRAP MICHAEL

00:03:54.161 --> 00:03:54.460
FLYNN.

00:03:54.461 --> 00:03:57.330
COMEY EVEN ADMITS IT WHEN HE

00:03:57.331 --> 00:04:00.299
PULLS OFF THE MASK OF CARDINAL

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.436
COMEY TO REVEAL THE FACE OF A

00:04:03.437 --> 00:04:07.006
HARDENED POLITICAL OPERATIVE WHO

00:04:07.007 --> 00:04:07.907
DELIBERATELY TRAPPED ANYONE.

00:04:07.908 --> 00:04:11.644
HE NOT ONLY ADMITTED IT, HE

00:04:11.645 --> 00:04:15.014
BRIDED HIMSELF ON WHAT ANY OTHER

00:04:15.015 --> 00:04:17.650
DECENT MAN OF HONOR WOULD HAVE

00:04:17.651 --> 00:04:19.652
BEEN HORRIFIED TO ADMIT.

00:04:19.653 --> 00:04:22.555
THAT THE RULES, THE LAW, AND THE

00:04:22.556 --> 00:04:26.626
CONSTITUTION MATTER NOT WHEN

00:04:26.627 --> 00:04:27.927
POLITICS IS AT STAKE.

00:04:27.928 --> 00:04:29.495
&gt;&gt; SOMETHING I PROBABLY WOULDN'T

00:04:29.496 --> 00:04:31.597
HAVE DONE OR MAYBE GONE THE AWAY

00:04:31.598 --> 00:04:34.233
WITH IN A MORE ORGANIZED

00:04:34.234 --> 00:04:36.535
INVESTIGATION -- MORE ORGANIZED

00:04:36.536 --> 00:04:39.105
ADMINISTRATION, IN THE GEORGE W.

00:04:39.106 --> 00:04:43.643
BUSH OR OBAMA ADMINISTRATION.

00:04:43.644 --> 00:04:44.744
JUDGE JEANINE: SOMETHING HE

00:04:44.745 --> 00:04:46.112
WOULDN'T HAVE GONE THE AWAY WITH

00:04:46.113 --> 00:04:48.814
IN ANY OTHER ADMINISTRATION?

00:04:48.815 --> 00:04:49.682
TO BE CLEAR.

00:04:49.683 --> 00:04:52.551
THE FBI WENT TO GREAT LENGTHS TO

00:04:52.552 --> 00:04:55.321
DISAVOW FLYNN OF ANY CONCERNS.

00:04:55.322 --> 00:04:57.490
TELLING HIM YOUR LAWYER DOESN'T

00:04:57.491 --> 00:04:59.558
NEED TO BE THERE.

00:04:59.559 --> 00:05:02.762
A PLAN COMEY AND STRZOK AND PAGE

00:05:02.763 --> 00:05:03.729
STRATEGIZED TO KEEP THE

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:05.097
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE OUT.

00:05:05.098 --> 00:05:06.866
WE KNOW THERE WERE MANY

00:05:06.867 --> 00:05:08.100
ARGUMENTS ABOUT WHETHER OR NOT

00:05:08.101 --> 00:05:11.170
THEY COULD AND SHOULD DO THIS.

00:05:11.171 --> 00:05:14.006
YOU MAY BE SITTING THERE SAYING

00:05:14.007 --> 00:05:17.977
HEY, FLYNN WAS A GENERAL, HE

00:05:17.978 --> 00:05:21.047
SHOULD HAVE KNOWN NOT TO LIE.

00:05:21.048 --> 00:05:22.148
YOU ARE RIGHT.

00:05:22.149 --> 00:05:23.616
BUT WHAT IS A LIE?

00:05:23.617 --> 00:05:27.119
IS IT A MISTAKE?

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:34.093
A MISREMEMBRANCE, A MEMORY THAT

00:05:34.094 --> 00:05:35.194
DOESN'T REMEMBER EVERYTHING.

00:05:35.195 --> 00:05:36.228
OR UNTRUTH.

00:05:36.229 --> 00:05:38.464
IF AN UNTRUTH DOESN'T REQUIRE AN

00:05:38.465 --> 00:05:43.169
INTENT TO DECEIVE TO BE A LIE.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.104
FLYNN KNEW THAT ANY CONVERSATION

00:05:45.105 --> 00:05:46.906
HE HAD WITH THE RUSSIANS WAS

00:05:46.907 --> 00:05:48.674
RECORD AND THE FBI WOULD

00:05:48.675 --> 00:05:50.009
CERTAINLY HAVE A TRANSCRIPT OF

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.877
HIS CONVERSATION WITH THE

00:05:51.878 --> 00:05:52.778
RUSSIAN AMBASSADOR SO THERE

00:05:52.779 --> 00:05:56.882
WOULD BE NO POINT IN LYING.

00:05:56.883 --> 00:05:58.250
EVEN MORE COMPELLING.

00:05:58.251 --> 00:06:01.220
AGENT STRZOK AND OTHER FBI AGENT

00:06:01.221 --> 00:06:03.723
TO INTERVIEWED FLYNN SAY HE DID

00:06:03.724 --> 00:06:06.258
NOT LIE.

00:06:06.259 --> 00:06:06.726
QUOTE.

00:06:06.727 --> 00:06:08.694
BOTH HAD THE IMPRESSION AT THE

00:06:08.695 --> 00:06:11.063
TIME THAT FLYNN WAS NOT LYING.

00:06:11.064 --> 00:06:13.799
AND DID NOT THINK HE WAS LYING.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.335
THEY EVEN SAID HE WAS UNGUARD

00:06:16.336 --> 00:06:18.270
AND FRIENDLY.

00:06:18.271 --> 00:06:19.438
THE NOTES FURTHER DESCRIBE THAT

00:06:19.439 --> 00:06:21.507
FLYNN DID NOT GIVE ANY

00:06:21.508 --> 00:06:23.743
INDICATION OF DECEPTION.

00:06:23.744 --> 00:06:25.511
CURIOUS, HOWEVER, IS THE FALL

00:06:25.512 --> 00:06:27.880
OUR OF THE FBI AND THE SPECIAL

00:06:27.881 --> 00:06:32.852
COUNSEL TO PROVIDE THE FBI'S 302

00:06:32.853 --> 00:06:36.589
OF FLYNN TO JUDGE SULLIVAN.

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.958
HOW DOES THE FBI FILE A FALSE

00:06:38.959 --> 00:06:40.593
STATEMENT CHARGE WHEN THE FBI

00:06:40.594 --> 00:06:41.594
THOUGHT IT WAS IN LIE.

00:06:41.595 --> 00:06:44.196
YOU ARE PROBABLY ASKING

00:06:44.197 --> 00:06:46.632
YOURSELF, WHY WOULD FLYNN EVEN

00:06:46.633 --> 00:06:48.734
PLEAD GUILTY TO LYING WHEN HE

00:06:48.735 --> 00:06:49.301
WASN'T LYING.

00:06:49.302 --> 00:06:51.370
THE ANSWER?

00:06:51.371 --> 00:06:54.407
FLYNN BASED ON HIS RECORD OF 33

00:06:54.408 --> 00:06:57.176
YEARS AS A DECORATED MILITARY

00:06:57.177 --> 00:07:00.646
MAN IS AN HONORABLE MAN WHO MAY

00:07:00.647 --> 00:07:03.749
HAVE REALIZED WHEN HE SAW THE

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.651
TRANSCRIPT THAT WHAT HE SAID WAS

00:07:05.652 --> 00:07:06.485
NOT CONSISTENT WITH THE

00:07:06.486 --> 00:07:06.886
TRANSCRIPT.

00:07:06.887 --> 00:07:07.153
ER.

00:07:07.154 --> 00:07:09.288
&gt;&gt; MAYBE HE PLED GUILTY BECAUSE

00:07:09.289 --> 00:07:11.090
HE RAN OUT OF MONEY TO DEFEND

00:07:11.091 --> 00:07:11.657
HIMSELF.

00:07:11.658 --> 00:07:13.859
EVEN HAVING TO SELL HIS HOUSE TO

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.060
SURVIVE.

00:07:15.061 --> 00:07:19.165
OR MAYBE TO SAVE HIS SON, ALSO

00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:21.033
IN THE CROSS-HAIRS OF THESE

00:07:21.034 --> 00:07:21.367
PEOPLE.

00:07:21.368 --> 00:07:23.636
FOR THOSE OF YOU WHO THINK THE

00:07:23.637 --> 00:07:25.438
FBI WAS JUST TRYING TO GET TO

00:07:25.439 --> 00:07:28.140
THE TRUTH, YOU ARE WRONG.

00:07:28.141 --> 00:07:30.876
IF THEY WANTED INFORMATION, IF

00:07:30.877 --> 00:07:32.778
THEY WANTED THE TRUTH, THEY

00:07:32.779 --> 00:07:34.980
COULD HAVE SHOWN FLYNN HIS

00:07:34.981 --> 00:07:37.783
TRANSCRIPT OF HIS CONVERSATION

00:07:37.784 --> 00:07:39.218
TO REFRESH HIS RECOLLECTION TO

00:07:39.219 --> 00:07:42.421
GET AT THE TRUTH.

00:07:42.422 --> 00:07:45.090
BUT, NO, THEY DIDN'T WANT THE

00:07:45.091 --> 00:07:45.424
TRUTH.

00:07:45.425 --> 00:07:48.594
THEY WANTED TO TAKE DOWN A BIT

00:07:48.595 --> 00:07:55.134
PLAYER TO GET TO THE BIG PLAYER.

00:07:55.135 --> 00:07:57.670
TUESDAY THE PARTIES WILL APPEAR

00:07:57.671 --> 00:08:01.373
AGAIN BEFORE JUDGE EMMETT

00:08:01.374 --> 00:08:03.242
SULLIVAN, A JUDGE UNAFRAID OF

00:08:03.243 --> 00:08:03.943
THE SWAMP.

00:08:03.944 --> 00:08:07.046
A JUDGE WITH A TRACK RECORD OF

00:08:07.047 --> 00:08:09.014
CALLING OUT PROSECUTORIAL

00:08:09.015 --> 00:08:09.548
MISCONDUCT.

00:08:09.549 --> 00:08:12.451
A JUDGE WHO DOES NOT PERMIT

00:08:12.452 --> 00:08:14.553
INJUSTICE OR ABUSE OF POWER.

00:08:14.554 --> 00:08:16.856
THE JUDGE CAN THROW OUT THIS

